# Simple Calculator Test
# This tests basic UniControl functionality

log Starting Calculator test
launch Calculator
wait 3

log Clicking number 5
find 5 role: AXButton
click
wait 0.5

log Clicking plus button
find + role: AXButton
click
wait 0.5

log Clicking number 3
find 3 role: AXButton
click
wait 0.5

log Clicking equals button
find = role: AXButton
click
wait 0.5

log Test complete! Result should be 8 in Calculator
